commit b35cc40eb4ee86a191ea21a1db60341a791f2c60
Author: Enrico Sabbadin <esabbadin@codearchitects.com>
Date:   Wed Oct 14 14:04:34 2026 +0200

    Add investigation harness and two self-contained investigations

    - lib/claude-home.mjs: shared harness. Binds each run to its investigation
      folder, isolates it (CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR per folder, ancestor CLAUDE.md
      excluded), syncs the login, writes dated run folders with run.json and
      headed summaries recording the Claude Code versions that actually ran.
    - investigations/subagent-background-behaviour: nested background subagents,
      parallel fan-out and SendMessage resume (SDK and claude -p), original
      results plus the 2026-10-14 isolated reruns that confirmed them.
    - investigations/askuserquestion-relay: AskUserQuestion relay and resume of
      the same subagent, original results plus the confirming rerun.
    - Each investigation keeps its own fixture, prompts, drivers, session logs
      and REPORT.html; CLAUDE.md documents the layout and workflow.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0154V8uxBK4U6uzJ7czEeNT5

